### Answer

A scalable Express project separates responsibilities into different folders.

### Folder Structure

```text
project/

├── controllers/
├── routes/
├── models/
├── middleware/
├── services/
├── utils/
├── config/
├── validators/
├── uploads/
├── app.js
└── server.js
```

### Flow

```text
Client

↓

Routes

↓

Middleware

↓

Controller

↓

Service

↓

Model

↓

Database
```

This structure improves readability, maintainability, and scalability.

